n begin="00:19.570" end="00:19.810">don't </span><span begin="00:19.810" end="00:20.080">take </span><span begin="00:20.080" end="00:20.200">the </span><span begin="00:20.200" end="00:21.550">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.810" end="00:27.010"><span begin="00:22.810" end="00:23.080">Don't </span><span begin="00:23.080" end="00:23.380">see </span><span begin="00:23.380" end="00:23.590">no </span><span begin="00:23.590" end="00:24.130">fancy </span><span begin="00:24.130" end="00:25.360">ring</span><span begin="00:25.360" end="00:25.570">, </span><span begin="00:25.570" end="00:26.050">ah </span><span begin="00:26.050" end="00:27.010">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.910" end="00:29.890"><span begin="00:27.910" end="00:28.360">Falling </span><span begin="00:28.360" end="00:28.540">in </span><span begin="00:28.540" end="00:28.750">love </span><span begin="00:28.750" end="00:28.840">on </span><span begin="00:28.840" end="00:28.930">the </span><span begin="00:28.930" end="00:29.290">first </span><span begin="00:29.290" end="00:29.890">date</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.070" end="00:32.020"><span begin="00:30.070" end="00:30.220">I </span><span begin="00:30.220" end="00:30.520">don't </span><span begin="00:30.520" end="00:30.760">even </span><span begin="00:30.760" end="00:31.000">know </span><span begin="00:31.000" end="00:31.150">your </span><span begin="00:31.150" end="00:31.480">last </span><span begin="00:31.480" end="00:32.020">name</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.170" end="00:35.710"><span begin="00:32.170" end="00:32.380">You're </span><span begin="00:32.380" end="00:32.710">living </span><span begin="00:32.710" end="00:32.920">off </span><span begin="00:32.920" end="00:33.370">daddy's </span><span begin="00:33.370" end="00:34.210">money</span><span begin="00:34.210" end="00:34.240">, </span><span begin="00:34.240" end="00:34.450">but </span><span begin="00:34.450" end="00:35.710">honey</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.670" end="00:38.590"><span begin="00:36.670" end="00:37.060">Even </span><span begin="00:37.060" end="00:37.240">though </span><span begin="00:37.240" end="00:37.480">these </span><span begin="00:37.480" end="00:37.600">are </span><span begin="00:37.600" end="00:37.690">our </span><span begin="00:37.690" end="00:38.020">best </span><span begin="00:38.020" end="00:38.590">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.740" end="00:40.690"><span begin="00:38.740" end="00:38.950">We </span><span begin="00:38.950" end="00:39.190">only </span><span begin="00:39.190" end="00:39.460">do </span><span begin="00:39.460" end="00:39.700">things </span><span begin="00:39.700" end="00:39.810">in </span><span begin="00:39.810" end="00:39.900">the </span><span begin="00:39.900" end="00:40.210">worst </span><span begin="00:40.210" end="00:40.690">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.020" end="00:44.350"><span begin="00:41.020" end="00:41.620">Let </span><span begin="00:41.620" end="00:42.130">your </span><span begin="00:42.130" end="00:42.700">hair </span><span begin="00:42.700" end="00:43.090">down </span><span begin="00:43.090" end="00:43.240">and </span><span begin="00:43.240" end="00:43.660">dance </span><span begin="00:43.660" end="00:43.840">with </span><span begin="00:43.840" end="00:44.350">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.350" end="00:48.160"><span begin="00:44.350" end="00:44.740">Give </span><span begin="00:44.740" end="00:45.220">into </span><span begin="00:45.220" end="00:45.430">your </span><span begin="00:45.430" end="00:45.880">dark </span><span begin="00:45.880" end="00:46.750">side</span><span begin="00:46.750" end="00:46.780">, </span><span begin="00:46.780" end="00:47.050">your </span><span begin="00:47.050" end="00:47.500">dark </span><span begin="00:47.500" end="00:48.160">side</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.190" end="00:53.020"><span begin="00:48.190" end="00:48.640">I've </span><span begin="00:48.640" end="00:49.090">seen </span><span begin="00:49.090" end="00:49.240">the </span><span begin="00:49.240" end="00:49.600">way </span><span begin="00:49.600" end="00:49.900">you </span><span begin="00:49.900" end="00:50.200">look </span><span begin="00:50.200" end="00:50.380">at </span><span begin="00:50.380" end="00:50.950">me</span><span begin="00:50.950" end="00:51.130">; </span><span begin="00:51.130" end="00:51.430">it </span><span begin="00:51.430" end="00:52.000">feels </span><span begin="00:52.000" end="00:52.510">right</span><span begin="00:52.510" end="00:52.660">, </span><span begin="00:52.660" end="00:53.020">ah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.080" end="00:56.890"><span begin="00:53.080" end="00:53.470">There's </span><span begin="00:53.470" end="00:53.650">no </span><span begin="00:53.650" end="00:53.920">need </span><span begin="00:53.920" end="00:54.760">convincing </span><span begin="00:54.760" end="00:55.150">me </span><span begin="00:55.150" end="00:55.240">of </span><span begin="00:55.240" end="00:55.630">things </span><span begin="00:55.630" end="00:55.990">you </span><span begin="00:55.990" end="00:56.890">should</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.950" end="00:59.710"><span begin="00:56.950" end="00:57.250">Oh</span><span begin="00:57.250" end="00:57.250">, </span><span begin="00:57.250" end="00:57.400">I </span><span begin="00:57.400" end="00:57.730">know </span><span begin="00:57.730" end="00:57.970">you </span><span begin="00:57.970" end="00:58.390">got </span><span begin="00:58.390" end="00:58.510">a </span><span begin="00:58.510" end="00:58.990">dark </span><span begin="00:58.990" end="00:59.710">side</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.920" end="01:10.720"><span begin="00:59.920" end="01:00.160">Oh</span><span begin="01:00.160" end="01:00.160">, </span><span begin="01:00.160" end="01:00.520">won't </span><span begin="01:00.520" end="01:00.670">you </span><span begin="01:00.670" end="01:01.120">give </span><span begin="01:01.120" end="01:01.240">it </span><span begin="01:01.240" end="01:01.510">to </span><span begin="01:01.510" end="01:02.980">me</span><span begin="01:02.980" end="01:10.720">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.720" end="01:13.900"><span begin="01:10.720" end="01:11.080">My </span><span begin="01:11.080" end="01:11.440">lips </span><span begin="01:11.440" end="01:11.530">are </span><span begin="01:11.530" end="01:11.920">numb</span><span begin="01:11.920" end="01:11.920">; </span><span begin="01:11.920" end="01:12.190">can't </span><span begin="01:12.190" end="01:12.490">walk </span><span begin="01:12.490" end="01:12.610">the </span><span begin="01:12.610" end="01:13.900">line</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.100" end="01:19.540"><span begin="01:15.100" end="01:15.520">Why </span><span begin="01:15.520" end="01:15.760">don't </span><span begin="01:15.760" end="01:15.910">you </span><span begin="01:15.910" end="01:16.360">try </span><span begin="01:16.360" end="01:16.510">it </span><span begin="01:16.510" end="01:17.740">too</span><span begin="01:17.740" end="01:19.540">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.540" end="01:22.630"><span begin="01:19.540" end="01:19.810">I </span><span begin="01:19.810" end="01:20.080">like </span><span begin="01:20.080" end="01:20.200">the </span><span begin="01:20.200" end="01:20.680">red</span><span begin="01:20.680" end="01:20.680">, </span><span begin="01:20.680" end="01:20.950">hope </span><span begin="01:20.950" end="01:21.100">you </span><span begin="01:21.100" end="01:21.250">don't </span><span begin="01:21.250" end="01:22.630">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.800" end="01:28.360"><span begin="01:23.800" end="01:23.980">And </span><span begin="01:23.980" end="01:24.160">it </span><span begin="01:24.160" end="01:24.460">tastes </span><span begin="01:24.460" end="01:24.670">so </span><span begin="01:24.670" end="01:25.060">good </span><span begin="01:25.060" end="01:25.270">on </span><span begin="01:25.270" end="01:26.290">you</span><span begin="01:26.290" end="01:26.410">, </span><span begin="01:26.410" end="01:27.340">ooh</span><span begin="01:27.340" end="01:27.370">, </span><span begin="01:27.370" end="01:28.360">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.020" end="01:30.970"><span begin="01:29.020" end="01:29.440">Falling </span><span begin="01:29.440" end="01:29.650">in </span><span begin="01:29.650" end="01:29.830">love </span><span begin="01:29.830" end="01:29.920">on </span><span begin="01:29.920" end="01:30.010">the </span><span begin="01:30.010" end="01:30.370">first </span><span begin="01:30.370" end="01:30.970">date</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.150" end="01:33.040"><span begin="01:31.150" end="01:31.300">I </span><span begin="01:31.300" end="01:31.630">don't </span><span begin="01:31.630" end="01:31.870">even </span><span begin="01:31.870" end="01:32.080">know </span><span begin="01:32.080" end="01:32.230">your </span><span begin="01:32.230" end="01:32.590">last </span><span begin="01:32.590" end="01:33.040">name</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.250" end="01:36.820"><span begin="01:33.250" end="01:33.460">You're </span><span begin="01:33.460" end="01:33.790">living </span><span begin="01:33.790" end="01:34.000">off </span><span begin="01:34.000" end="01:34.450">daddy's </span><span begin="01:34.450" end="01:35.290">money</span><span begin="01:35.290" end="01:35.320">, </span><span begin="01:35.320" end="01:35.530">but </span><span begin="01:35.530" end="01:36.820">honey</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.750" end="01:39.700"><span begin="01:37.750" end="01:38.140">Even </span><span begin="01:38.140" end="01:38.350">though </span><span begin="01:38.350" end="01:38.590">these </span><span begin="01:38.590" end="01:38.680">are </span><span begin="01:38.680" end="01:38.770">our </span><span begin="01:38.770" end="01:39.100">best </span><span begin="01:39.100" end="01:39.700">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.820" end="01:41.710"><sp